<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S10" title="In UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">10 </span>Additional Results for Training Strategies</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S11" title="In UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">11 </span>Effects of Training Data Size</span></a></li>
