<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Data Example for Three Stages</h2>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below, we provide examples for each stage.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2506.23219v1/figs/examples-3-stages-v2.png" id="S7.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:329/277;" width="329" height="277" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S7.F9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>: </span><span id="S7.F9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Input data examples for three-stage training.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
