<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">8 </span>Comparing with models for single-modality urban tasks</h2>

<div id="S8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We focus on comparing our approach with these modality-specific models to better showcase its effectiveness, which are presented in following Table <a href="#S8.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 8 Comparing with models for single-modality urban tasks ‣ UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
