<div id="S15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S15.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ 15 Urban Instruction Data ‣ UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> provides detailed statistics of <span id="S15.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">UData</span> across three cities, while Table <a href="#S15.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ 15 Urban Instruction Data ‣ UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> presents the detailed statistics of the raw data used to construct <span id="S15.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">UData</span>. Additionally, we present representative examples of our urban instruction data, as shown in Figure <a href="#S15.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ 15 Urban Instruction Data ‣ UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a> to Figure <a href="#S15.F35" title="Figure 35 ‣ 15 Urban Instruction Data ‣ UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large Language Model for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">35</span></a>.</p>
</div>
