<span id="S15.F23.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S15.F23.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User:<span id="S15.F23.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> &lt;image &gt;\n What is shown in this street view image? And what related pois could be estimated nearby</span></span></span>
