<span id="S15.F26.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S15.F26.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Assistant:<span id="S15.F26.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You are given one street view image &lt;image&gt;and four satellite images. Which satellite image shows the surroundings of the street view image?
